WEBVTT

00:10:30.739 --> 00:10:31.969
ja selle asemel ta teeb ...

00:10:32.604 --> 00:10:35.022
Me nimetame seda poolikuks kadentsiks,

00:10:35.076 --> 00:10:36.388
sest ei paku lahendust.

00:10:36.412 --> 00:10:38.837
Ma räägin oma õpilastele:
"Kui tuleb poolik kadents,

00:10:38.837 --> 00:10:41.216
tõstke oma kulme,
siis kõik teavad."

00:10:41.216 --> 00:10:42.839
(Naer)

00:10:43.048 --> 00:10:44.618
(Aplaus)

00:10:48.498 --> 00:10:50.394
Ta jõuab E-sse, 
aga see on vale akord.

00:10:50.394 --> 00:10:51.639
Ta proovib veel E-d.

00:10:51.663 --> 00:10:53.089
See akord ei sobi.

00:10:53.089 --> 00:10:55.545
Ta proovib E-d jälle.
See akord ei sobi.

00:10:55.569 --> 00:10:57.678
Ta proovib veel E-d,
ja see ei sobi.

00:10:58.124 --> 00:10:59.274
Ja lõpuks...